---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';

const ctaHref = '/contato';
---

<section
  id="cta-final"
  class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-navy"
>
  <!-- Decorative C/N watermarks -->
  <span
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-12 -left-10 select-none text-[280px] font-bold leading-none text-white/[0.06] md:-left-6 md:text-[420px]"
  >
    CN
  </span>
  <span
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-12 select-none text-[280px] font-bold leading-none text-white/[0.06] md:-right-8 md:text-[420px]"
  >
    CN
  </span>

  <div
    class="relative mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[896px] flex-col items-center gap-6 px-6 py-16 text-center md:py-20"
  >
    <h2
      class="italic font-medium text-white text-[32px] leading-tight tracking-[-0.8px] md:text-[48px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]"
      style="font-family: var(--font-serif);"
    >
      Pronto para proteger seu<br class="hidden md:inline" /> patrimônio?
    </h2>

    <p
      class="max-w-[591px] text-[16px] font-normal leading-[26px] text-white/70 md:text-[18px] md:leading-7"
    >
      Agende uma reunião estratégica e descubra como podemos proteger seus
      bens e investimentos.
    </p>

    <a
      href={ctaHref}
      class="btn btn-primary btn-md mt-2"
    >
      <span>Falar com especialista</span>
      <Icon name="arrow-right" size={20} />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
